Query parameters: Add ?author=<name> and ?year=<year> as optional filters to /books.

Expected behavior:

GET /books                    → all books
GET /books?author=Orwell      → books where author matches "Orwell"  
GET /books?year=1945          → books where year = 1945
GET /books?author=Orwell&year=1945  → books matching BOTH filters

Server Implementation Pattern

GET /books:
1. Start with full books collection
2. If `author` param exists → filter collection where book.author == param
3. If `year` param exists → filter collection where book.year == param  
4. Return filtered results (with pagination if needed)
